  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed development, by reason of the scale and design of the side extension together with the hip-to-gable roof extension, would result in a bulky, unsympathetic and visually intrusive extension that significantly harms the appearance of the house itself, unbalances the pair of semi-detached dwellings and harms the wider character of the area. The proposal therefore fails to comply with adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the Residential Extension Guidelines"
